{
  "uid": "wikiguard-free-tier",
  "title": "WikiGuard / Free-tier usage",
  "description": "Every limit WikiGuard can measure from inside the cluster, against its free allowance (docs/cost.md). Nothing may start billing (DEC-001).",
  "tags": [
    "wikiguard"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Oracle VM (Always Free A1)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "id": 1,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU busy, and Oracle's idle line",
      "description": "Oracle may reclaim an A1 VM whose 95th-percentile CPU and memory both stay under 20% for 7 days. The band shows 20%.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "1 - avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "CPU busy",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line+area"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memory used",
      "description": "Under 20% for a week counts toward reclaim, as CPU does.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "1 - sum(node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes) / sum(node_memory_MemTotal_bytes)",
          "legendFormat": "memory used",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line+area"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Disk used",
      "description": "Alert at 80%. The boot volume is part of the 200 GB free block storage.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "1 - sum(node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|overlay\"}) / sum(node_filesystem_size_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|overlay\"})",
          "legendFormat": "disk used",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line+area"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.8
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Storage",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "id": 5,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Archive, of Oracle's 20 GB",
      "description": "The working copy, which the nightly mirror copies to Object Storage (DEC-083).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(archiver_archive_bytes) / (20 * 1024^3)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.7
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.8
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Supabase database, of 500 MB",
      "description": "The retention job shortens the windows at 85% and 95%.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "wikiguard-postgres"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "rawSql": "SELECT pg_database_size(current_database()) / (500.0 * 1024 * 1024)",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "wikiguard-postgres"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.7
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.85
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Edits per day",
      "description": "What drives Supabase's size and the archive's growth (docs/capacity.md).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(ingestor_published_total[24h]))",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "id": 8,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Calls",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "id": 9,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM calls per day",
      "description": "OpenAI is prepaid and Gemini is free. Both stop at the daily cap.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "wikiguard-postgres"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "rawSql": "SELECT day::timestamptz AS time, provider AS metric, calls AS value FROM llm_usage WHERE $__timeFilter(day::timestamptz) ORDER BY 1",
          "format": "time_series",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "wikiguard-postgres"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 10,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Checked by hand",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "These limits have no API this cluster can read for free, so they're read from each dashboard and recorded in `docs/cost.md`:\n\n| Service | Free limit | Where to read it |\n|---|---|---|\n| Render | 750 instance hours a month, shared | Render dashboard, Billing |\n| Vercel Hobby | Function and bandwidth allowances | Vercel dashboard, Usage |\n| Cloudflare Workers | 100,000 requests a day | Cloudflare dashboard, Workers |\n| Supabase | 5 GB egress a month | Supabase dashboard, Usage |\n| Oracle Object Storage | 50,000 requests a month | Oracle console, Cost Analysis |\n| DagsHub | Storage (F-071) | DagsHub repo settings |"
      },
      "id": 11,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      }
    }
  ],
